and get talked about.

00:06:47.611 --> 00:06:50.156
Like the couple with the new baby.

00:06:50.156 --> 00:06:53.492
Why did she end up
picking tickle torture for him?

00:06:53.492 --> 00:06:56.871
Well, she felt like
he needed to lose control,

00:06:56.912 --> 00:06:58.956
